problems.q:
An engineer wants a property that the FIFO never overflows. Which SVA form expresses a safety property of this kind?

A) assume property (@(posedge clk) full);

B) cover property (@(posedge clk) push && full);

C) assert property (@(posedge clk) disable iff (rst) !(push && full));

D) assert property (@(posedge clk) push |-> full);
